    "section": "Glossary",
    "snapshot": {
      "plain": "Layered Stasis Matter that grants up to 50% [16%] Damage Resist at x7 stacks.\nFrost Armor stacks last for 5 seconds and decay 1 stack at a time.\n\nEach stack of Frost Armor grants 1/7th of the maximum Damage Resist.\n By default, stacks grant 7.14% [2.29%] Damage Resist, maxing out at 35.7% [11.4%] Damage Resist at x5 stacks\n\nFrost Armor's 7-stack Maximum Damage Resist is reduced by -8% [-2.25%] for each Generic \"Resist\" stack.\nFrost Armor's Maximum Damage Resist | x1 = 42% [13.75%] | x2 = 34% [11.5%] | x3 = 26% [9.25%] | x4 = 18% [7%]\n\nWhile Woven Mail is active:\n Frost Armor's 7-Stack Maximum Damage Resist is lowered to 30%, with an additional reduction of -2% [0%] per Resist stack.\nMaximum Damage Resist | x0 = 30% | x1 = 28% | x2 = 26% | x3 = 24% | x4 = 22%\n\nWhile Super Ability is active:\n Frost Armor's 7-Stack Maximum Damage Resist is lowered to 30% [8%], with an additional reduction of -2.5% [-1.13%] per Resist stack.\nMaximum Damage Resist | x0 = 30% [8%] | x1 = 27.5% [6.9%] | x2 = 25% [5.7%] | x3 = 22.5% [4.6%] | x4 = 20% [3.5%]\n\nWhisper of Rime:\nIncreases the maximum stack amount to x7, increasing the maximum Damage Resist to 50% [16%]\nIncreases the Frost Armor stack duration to 6 seconds.",
